# Enhanced Business Case Template
# Provides strategic value and organizational benefits analysis

meta:
  name: "business_case"
  type: "enhanced_content"
  purpose: "Strategic value proposition for career transitions"

content: |
  **Strategic Value**: Leverages existing {source_job_function} expertise while building {target_job_function} capabilities, supporting organizational agility and internal mobility.
  
  **Resource Optimization**: Internal transition reduces recruitment costs and accelerates capability building through existing institutional knowledge and cultural alignment.
  
  **Risk Mitigation**: {similarity_score:.1%} skill similarity provides strong foundation for successful transition with {percentile_rank:.0f}th percentile confidence level.
  
  **Workforce Impact**: Affects {source_total_positions} source positions with {target_total_positions} target opportunities, enabling strategic redeployment.

variables:
  source_job_function:
    description: "Job function of source role"
    type: "string"
    
  target_job_function:
    description: "Job function of target role"
    type: "string"
    
  similarity_score:
    description: "Similarity score between roles"
    type: "float"
    
  percentile_rank:
    description: "Percentile ranking of similarity"
    type: "float"
    
  source_total_positions:
    description: "Number of positions in source role"
    type: "integer"
    
  target_total_positions:
    description: "Number of positions in target role"
    type: "integer" 
